{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05388","headline":"奉和圣制同二相已下羣官乐游园宴 · 崔沔","name":"奉和圣制同二相已下羣官乐游园宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五日酺才毕，千年乐未央。\n复承天所赐，终宴国之阳。\n地胜春逾好，恩深乐更张。\n落花飞广座，垂柳拂行觞。\n庶尹陪三史，诸侯具万方。\n酒酣同拚跃，歌舞咏时康。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔沔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05388.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05388","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}